{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"921a220806f68d66de57b27dd59223eb1b066e8d56be04c3105a8636a6e23e70","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶路撒冷的混亂"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"主－萬軍之耶和華從耶路撒冷和猶大，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉眾人所倚靠的，所仗賴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是所倚靠的糧，所仗賴的水；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉勇士和戰士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"審判官和先知，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"占卜的和長老，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五十夫長和尊貴人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謀士和有巧藝的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以及妙行法術的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主說：我必使孩童作他們的首領，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使嬰孩轄管他們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓要彼此欺壓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"各人受鄰舍的欺壓。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"少年人必侮慢老年人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卑賤人必侮慢尊貴人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"人在父家拉住弟兄，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你有衣服，可以作我們的官長。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這敗落的事歸在你手下吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，他必揚聲說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我不作醫治你們的人；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因我家中沒有糧食，也沒有衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們不可立我作百姓的官長。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶路撒冷敗落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大傾倒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們的舌頭和行為與耶和華反對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惹了他榮光的眼目。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"他們的面色證明自己的不正；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們述說自己的罪惡，並不隱瞞，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像所多瑪一樣。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們有禍了！因為作惡自害。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要論義人說：他必享福樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為要吃自己行為所結的果子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡人有禍了！他必遭災難！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為要照自己手所行的受報應。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於我的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"孩童欺壓他們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"婦女轄管他們。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的百姓啊，引導你的使你走錯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並毀壞你所行的道路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華審判他的子民"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"耶和華起來辯論，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"站着審判眾民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必審問他民中的長老和首領，說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃盡葡萄園果子的就是你們；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向貧窮人所奪的都在你們家中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主－萬軍之耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們為何壓制我的百姓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"搓磨貧窮人的臉呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對耶路撒冷女子的警告"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和華又說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為錫安的女子狂傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行走挺項，賣弄眼目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"俏步徐行，腳下玎璫，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，主必使錫安的女子頭長禿瘡；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華又使她們赤露下體。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["到那日，主必除掉她們華美的腳釧、髮網、月牙圈、"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["耳環、手鐲、蒙臉的帕子、"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["華冠、足鍊、華帶、香盒、符囊、"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["戒指、鼻環、"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["吉服、外套、雲肩、荷包、"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["手鏡、細麻衣、裹頭巾、蒙身的帕子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"text":"必有臭爛代替馨香，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"繩子代替腰帶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光禿代替美髮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麻衣繫腰代替華服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"烙傷代替美容。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的男丁必倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的勇士必死在陣上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"錫安","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"的城門必悲傷、哀號；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她必荒涼坐在地上。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"原文是她","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":26}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ISA/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}